SDL-E1041 (spec/access.md)

  x access variant not allowed at this level: `type: record` requires `on: database` (parser-enforced upstream)
   ,----
 1 | access account { on: root; type: record; signin: 1; };
   :                              ^^^^^^|^^^^^
   :                                    `-- this variant needs `on: database`
   `----
  help: record accesses (and bearer accesses for records) live at the database level — write `on: database;` (or `on: db;`)
